  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe serves 4 and takes 20 minutes to prepare and 5 minutes to cook. Fine bulgur wheat is soaked in boiling water and tossed with tomato, red pepper, spring onion, herbs, pomegranate molasses and sumac. The result is a bright, tangy salad that improves as it sits and the bulgur absorbs the dressing."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: use fine-grade bulgur wheat rather than coarse. It needs only boiling water to soften and absorbs the dressing much more evenly than coarser grades."
          }
        ]
      },
